--- body ---
## Context

`data/reference/vietnam_thermal_v1.csv` is frozen at commit `85a0e6c7` for
Exp1–3 (see `data/reference/PROVENANCE.md`). The Exp2 FP audit surfaced 17
`clean_name` collisions and mixed romanization. Line-by-line adjudication
(units_included in hand) re-diagnosed the picture: 1 romanization duplicate
(`Duyen Hai 2`), 1 transcription error (`Quảng Trị 1` "Unit 2, Unit 2"),
2 duplicated-name key collisions (`Dong Nai Formosa`, `Ha Tinh Formosa` —
distinct unit groups sharing one name string), and 14 distinct-plant pairs
that collide only after the cleaner's `^lng`/`^nd`/`^tbkhh`/paren drops.
Root cause of the first three: the unit→plant aggregator (ticket 0416).

## Delivered (final scope: leapfrog — document, measure, delegate)

An interim patched copy ("fix1") was built, twice reworked under author
review, measured, and finally dropped: nothing consumed it, its impact was
nil, and it duplicated upstream truth downstream. What ships:

- `PROVENANCE.md` § "Known defects of v1": the adjudications, the measured
  impact, the no-invented-names rule, and the expected-delta checklist for
  validating v2 at adoption (0413).
- `docs/fp-audit-exp2.md` § Outcome: proposals 3–4 settled by measurement.
- `experiments/scripts/fp_audit_exp2.py` gains `--reference/--label`
  (reference-swap recounts — the instrument that produced the numbers and
  will validate v2).
- Corrections delegated: master (DH2.1 already fixed there 2026-06-03) +
  regeneration pipeline 0420 (extraction, input validation) → 0416
  (aggregator, output validation: plant name = unique key) → 0419
  (consumers) → 0413 (adoption).

## Measured non-finding (audit before instrumenting)

Re-reconciling all 80 Exp2 runs against a corrected variant: FP 399->399;
FN 7617->7537 (the delta is phantom misses of the duplicate row; DNF/HTF FN
merely relabel — models rarely report those plants at all). The 14
`clean_name` collisions cause neither FP nor FN. FP is dominated by
`matcher_fail_lp_veto` (201 occ -> 0393) and `reference_hole` (99 occ ->
0395). Therefore the cleaner gate and `name_ascii` alias are deliberately
NOT implemented — no over-fitting the cleaner to the Vietnam instance.

## Exit criteria (final)

- [x] All 17 collision groups adjudicated by the author
- [x] FP/FN impact measured on existing outputs and explained
- [x] Defects, measurements and v2 expected-delta checklist recorded in
      `PROVENANCE.md`; fp-audit doc outcome updated
- [x] No patched reference shipped; no invented names anywhere
- [x] Corrections delegated with tickets in place (0420/0416/0419/0413;
      0395 rewired onto the pipe)

